'''Dying Sun''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Ruby Flask}}.

==Mechanics==
* {{ml|FlaskAdditionalProjectilesDuringEffectUnique__1|display=stat_text}}:
:Player can stack increased flask effect mod (such as {{c|mod|Flasks applied to you have #% increased Effect}} from belt) to 50%+ increased, so that the flask effect would be fires 3 additional projectiles instead of 2 additional. This can be achieved by [[passive skill]] from the main tree, from [[cluster jewel]], from [[List of jewel implicit mods|jewel implicit]] (crafted from [[Vivid Parasite]] [[harvest crafting]]), belt mod, etc.

* {{ml|FlaskChargesUsedUnique__5|display=stat_text}}:

:The mod is additive to other increase/reduced [[flask charges]] used modifiers, such as {{c|mod|#% reduced Flask Charges used}} modifier from the [[belt]]. Despite the item mod stated "charge", it means flask charge instead of [[power charge]], [[frenzy charge]] or [[endurance charge]], etc.

* {{c|mod|(40-60)% less Duration}} This mod is multiplicative to the effect of the [[quality#Effect on items|flask quality]].

{{Item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of (2.20-3.30) seconds instead.

{{Item skin list}}

